{"about_the_game":"<strong></strong>18 MINUTES<strong></strong>Welcome to &quot;18Minutes&quot;, the thrilling first-person shooter game that takes you back to 1984 and puts you in the shoes of a daring Eritrean commando operative on a mission to infiltrate and destroy an enemy airforce base. can you complete the mission in 18 minutes?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633200/extras/9c0b445f441de9d62a95cd38159b3b34.poster.avif?t=1702449125\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633200/extras/9c0b445f441de9d62a95cd38159b3b34.webm?t=1702449125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633200/extras/9c0b445f441de9d62a95cd38159b3b34.mp4?t=1702449125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>   <br><u>Stealth Mastery:</u><br> Work you way in to the heart of a heavily guarded Asmara Air force base. Become a shadow as you slip through enemy lines with unmatched stealth. Infiltrate guarded areas, evade vigilant guards, and reach your targets undetected.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633200/extras/1c31ee6ef766b3796361ffb21da5a8f1.poster.avif?t=1702449125\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633200/extras/1c31ee6ef766b3796361ffb21da5a8f1.webm?t=1702449125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633200/extras/1c31ee6ef766b3796361ffb21da5a8f1.mp4?t=1702449125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><u>Destructive Mayhem:</u><br> Unleash chaos within enemy base! Race against the clock to destroy planes, vehicles, and fuel tanks before they can retaliate. Leave destruction in your wake and watch the enemy scramble to understand what just hit them.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633200/extras/163228b6e55d630070c1cb1a14e9c324.poster.avif?t=1702449125\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633200/extras/163228b6e55d630070c1cb1a14e9c324.webm?t=1702449125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633200/extras/163228b6e55d630070c1cb1a14e9c324.mp4?t=1702449125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><u>Fast-Paced Gunplay:</u><br> Brace for intense, heart-pounding gun battles in Eritrean Commando. Engage in lightning-fast, close-quarters combat as waves of enemy soldiers swarm from all directions. Survive the onslaught and make a daring escape from the heart of the action-packed battlefield.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633200/extras/95940d277c0e4b660b62fe537370db5f.poster.avif?t=1702449125\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633200/extras/95940d277c0e4b660b62fe537370db5f.webm?t=1702449125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633200/extras/95940d277c0e4b660b62fe537370db5f.mp4?t=1702449125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>18 MINUTES showcases stunning graphics and audio that bring every moment to life. From the realistic weapon mechanics to the explosive visual effects, every aspect of the game is designed to provide a truly immersive and cinematic experience. Feel the rush of adrenaline as you unleash an arsenal of weaponry, including assault rifle, RPG, explosives, and more.<br><br>But 18 MINUTES Eritrean Commandos isn't just about the explosive gameplay; it also pays homage to the courage, dedication, and heroism of the actual Eritrean commandos. Learn about their untold stories and the challenges they faced as you embark on these missions. Gain a deeper understanding of the sacrifices made by these brave warriors, and feel a sense of awe and respect for their extraordinary feats.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2633200?t=1702449125","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633200/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1702449125","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633200/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1702449125","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633200/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1702449125","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<strong></strong>18 MINUTES<strong></strong>Welcome to &quot;18Minutes&quot;, the thrilling first-person shooter game that takes you back to 1984 and puts you in the shoes of a daring Eritrean commando operative on a mission to infiltrate and destroy an enemy airforce base. can you complete the mission in 18 minutes?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633200/extras/9c0b445f441de9d62a95cd38159b3b34.poster.avif?t=1702449125\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633200/extras/9c0b445f441de9d62a95cd38159b3b34.webm?t=1702449125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633200/extras/9c0b445f441de9d62a95cd38159b3b34.mp4?t=1702449125\" type=\"video/mp4\"><